# Islas Escarcha, floor 3 (C7, contract 53), 24 x 18, a cave: the bottom. Two platforms joined by a CHANNEL of animated water (`current`, surfable) with two RAPIDS on it (solid NPCs `rapids`, `gate=yes`, hide flags 855 / 856: they dissolve when the matching pit of floor 2 is
# plugged); AUROWL (L50, a legendary encounter (legend=)) on the far platform (19,5). Wild water table + frost-grass tufts + the three rods.
@map islas_escarcha_3
@size 24 18
@interior no
@cave yes
@area islas_escarcha
@bg 0
@surf yes
@flag esc_pit_a 855
@flag esc_pit_b 856
@flag aurowl_gone 857     # Aurowl was dealt with (won, caught or ran)
@encounters grass rate=14
  echowing 40 44 25
  echolet 40 44 5
  belubub 38 42 25
  plattypuzz 38 42 20
  lazatee 38 41 15
  barnacub 38 42 10
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=cdefg period=1800
@encounters water rate=12
  belubub 38 42 30
  barnacub 38 42 25
  plattypuzz 38 42 20
  lazatee 38 41 15
  belugrand 44 46 10
@end
@encounters fish_old
  flopfin 5 5 100
@end
@encounters fish_good rate=128
  inkit 24 28 50
  glidefin 24 28 50
@end
@encounters fish_super
  barnacub 34 38 40
  inkit 34 38 30
  belubub 34 38 30
@end
@spawn up 3 4 S
@legend
  .  tile=none
  a  tile=none object=snow_drift
  b  tile=none object=cwall
  c  tile=frost_tuft
  d  tile=ice_00
  e  tile=ice_10
  f  tile=ice_01
  g  tile=ice_11
  h  tile=current
  i  tile=ice_10 object=ice_pillar
  j  tile=ice_01 object=snow_drift
  k  tile=ice_00 object=ice_pillar
  l  tile=ice_11 door=rope_ladder
  m  tile=ice_11 object=snow_drift
  n  tile=current_gate face=S gate=yes hide_flag=esc_pit_a id=rapA npc=rapids text=esc3.rapids
  o  tile=current_gate face=S gate=yes hide_flag=esc_pit_b id=rapB npc=rapids text=esc3.rapids
  # Legendary encounter (contract 52): the legend= idiom; the hide flag is the story flag above (won, caught -> gone; Run keeps it)
  p  tile=ice_11 legend=aurowl level=50 npc=aurowl_ow hide_flag=aurowl_gone
  q  tile=ice_00 object=snow_drift
  r  tile=ice_01 object=ice_pillar
  s  tile=frost_tuft object=snow_drift
  t  tile=frost_tuft item=prime_salve
  H  tile=ice_11 hidden=savia_max   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
